# Frontend environment variables. Copy to .env and adjust.
# Variables MUST be prefixed with VITE_ to be exposed to the app.

# Base URL for the backend API.
# In development, leave this unset. The Vite dev server proxies /api/* to
# http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.ts), so requests stay same-origin
# and no CORS config is needed on the backend.
# In production, point this at your deployed backend, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.accesspath.example.com/api/v1
